WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.797 --> 00:00:08.634
I certainly hope you dance
as well as you dress.

00:00:09.468 --> 00:00:11.637
There's only one
way to find out.

00:00:11.637 --> 00:00:14.264
♪ Let's dance ♪

00:00:14.264 --> 00:00:18.769
♪ Put on your red shoes
and dance the blues ♪

00:00:18.769 --> 00:00:23.190
You and I, we're not so
different, agent Argylle.

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:26.693
Little help?
-Hold on.

00:00:36.203 --> 00:00:38.455
The book is phenomenal,
sweetie, but...

00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:41.124
What happens next?

00:00:41.124 --> 00:00:42.793
It's called a
cliffhanger, Mother.

00:00:42.793 --> 00:00:44.836
Elly, it's
called a cop out.

00:00:48.924 --> 00:00:51.218
Whoa, hey!
There's a cat in there.

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:55.180
Oh my God, you're
Elly freaking Conway.

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:59.059
[Announcer] Author of
"Argylle" series, Elly Conway!

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:00.560
I am such a fan!

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.729
Oh yeah? 
What is it you do?

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:05.023
Espionage.
-Would you sign my book?

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:08.235
Here we go.

00:01:12.656 --> 00:01:14.616
I love this book!

00:01:21.039 --> 00:01:22.124
C'mon.

00:01:29.172 --> 00:01:31.925
Who are these people?
-Real life spies.

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:33.593
Why would
they care about me?

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:36.096
Because you're a goddamn
fortune teller, Elly.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:39.224
What you wrote in your
new book actually happened

00:01:39.224 --> 00:01:40.434
and you kicked
a hornet's nest

00:01:40.434 --> 00:01:41.601
you didn't even
know existed.

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:43.687
I'm in some really
big trouble, Mom.

00:01:45.897 --> 00:01:48.900
Oh, so now you're
experimenting with drugs.

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:51.069
I want all assets
on them now.

00:01:51.069 --> 00:01:53.447
I need her to write
the next chapter.

00:01:58.827 --> 00:02:00.454
God, I hate that cat.

00:02:12.716 --> 00:02:14.009
Yeah!

00:02:16.928 --> 00:02:22.142
It's time for you to meet
the real agent Argylle.

00:02:23.226 --> 00:02:24.936
Oh my God.
-Oh my God.

00:02:24.936 --> 00:02:26.063
Oh.
-My.

00:02:26.063 --> 00:02:27.189
God.

